# bisync filters (SPEC §9.3). Versioned in the repo; the GUI never edits this.
# Changing it forces a --resync for every user: the worker detects the new MD5
# and sets needs_resync for all users; an admin must approve each one.
# "@SLUG@" is replaced with the configured slug when rendered.
- .@SLUG@-archive/**
- ~$*
- .~lock.*
- desktop.ini
- Thumbs.db
- .DS_Store
- *.tmp
- /Personal Vault/**
- .@SLUG@-check-*
- #recycle/**
- .snapshot/**
